# Xcode & Swift project .gitignore

## Build generated
build/
Build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint

## User data & Xcode user state
xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.workspaceuser

## Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/
.build/

## CocoaPods / Carthage
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

## macOS system files
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

## IDE & Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

## Temporary & Environment files
*.tmp
*.bak
.env
.env.local
